[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15060.79, "timestamp": "04:11:00", "text": "很多情緒交織在一起。  所以，是的，我得做很多安全方面的事情，對吧？  現在想想，我還是不想破壞我現在擁有的一切。我此刻擁有的平靜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15067.349, "timestamp": "04:11:07", "text": "正確的。  是的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15067.593, "timestamp": "04:11:07", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "its a be right back"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15083.75, "timestamp": "04:11:23", "text": "。我所經歷的那些可怕的事。  我不想讓這種情況在日本變得更糟，但現在更像是充滿挑戰，顯然會有更多挑戰，就像人生一樣，生活會給你很多挑戰，而你必須接受這些挑戰，而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15089.189, "timestamp": "04:11:29", "text": "不是逃避。即使你逃避，你也會面臨更艱難的挑戰，你必須面對它，你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15114.616, "timestamp": "04:11:54", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "maybe journal or right blogs when in Japan for let loose too"}]